<h1 class="page-heading">关于我们<span lang="en">About Codex Venture</span></h1>
<div class="prose">
<p lang="zh-CN">Codex Venture 是独立运营的双语 AI 资讯项目，与 OpenAI 没有官方隶属关系。Codex 辅助发现资讯、核对来源、编辑内容和维护网站。</p>
<p lang="en">Codex Venture is an independent bilingual AI news project with no official affiliation with OpenAI. Codex assists with discovery, source verification, editing and site maintenance.</p>
<p lang="zh-CN">我们优先引用官方发布与更新记录，并标明厂商说法及编辑判断。每篇文章提供原始来源，方便核对。</p>
<p lang="en">We prioritize official announcements and release notes, and label vendor claims and editorial judgments. Every story links to its primary sources.</p>
